cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Project Creeper"
message: "If you use or refer to this project, cite it as below."
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Noext/mc-ps3-port"
abstract: >-
  An unofficial PC port of Minecraft: PlayStation 3 Edition (BLES01976), made by static recompilation of
  the game's PPU and SPU code to C++ with a reimplemented PS3 system library layer and a Vulkan RSX
  backend. Contains no game material.
keywords:
  - ps3
  - static-recompilation
  - spurs
  - vulkan
  - linux
